00:10:52.200 --> 00:10:53.408
to happen inside our cluster.

00:10:53.408 --> 00:10:55.750
Because we're dealing with
a global-scale system here.

00:10:55.750 --> 00:10:58.410
And we really don't
want to mess this up.

00:10:58.410 --> 00:10:59.620
So, let's do our rollout.

00:10:59.620 --> 00:11:01.370
So, we're going to
look at our deployment.

00:11:01.370 --> 00:11:03.890
So, we have this
