00:11:08.560 --> 00:11:11.610
Roll-- update rollout.

00:11:11.610 --> 00:11:13.210
So we actually want
to roll it out.

00:11:13.210 --> 00:11:18.830
We're going to say our
default config is v1.

00:11:18.830 --> 00:11:23.460
And we want to do a dry run.

00:11:23.460 --> 00:11:26.390
And we want to do it
