00:13:13.230 --> 00:13:16.170
Part of both open-source Agones
and Google Cloud Game Servers

00:13:16.170 --> 00:13:19.140
working together is
multicluster allocation system.

00:13:19.140 --> 00:13:21.060
We actually have a
grPCM point that gets

00:13:21.060 --> 00:13:22.977
