them having a production
workload running

00:21:25.210 --> 00:21:26.658
on Agones right now.

00:21:26.658 --> 00:21:29.200
So if you want to get started
with Google Cloud Game Servers,

00:21:29.200 --> 00:21:30.880
you can do so right now.

00:21:30.880 --> 00:21:33.910
It is in public beta and
available to everyone.

00:21:33.910 --> 00:21:36.920
There is a two-phase rollout
that is happening here.

00:21:36.920 --> 00:21:39.460
So phase one, which is available
right now, as I just said,

00:21:39.460 --> 00:21:43.660
is GCP only and provides basic
policy management capabilities.

00:21:43.660 --> 00:21:46.120
This means that you can
run your applications

00:21:46.120 --> 00:21:49.630
and your games on GKE and you
have basic functionality that

00:21:49.630 --> 00:21:53.560
will deal with most of your
workloads for autoscaling

00:21:53.560 --> 00:21:56.170
and how you want to
manage your fleets.

00:21:56.170 --> 00:21:58.780
Phase two, which will come
in the near future and we're

00:21:58.780 --> 00:22:01.270
actively working
on, will provide

00:22:01.270 --> 00:22:04.030
more sophisticated and
advanced policy management

00:22:04.030 --> 00:22:06.970
in terms of allocation
or time-based scaling

00:22:06.970 --> 00:22:10.000
but also will provide multi
and hybrid cloud support, which

00:22:10.000 --> 00:22:12.430
we're also really excited
about, as well, because as we've

00:22:12.430 --> 00:22:14.050
been talking about,
sometimes you just

00:22:14.050 --> 00:22:16.300
need to be able to get these
game servers to players

00:22:16.300 --> 00:22:17.980
in the places that they are.

00:22:17.980 --> 00:22:21.190
And having that flexibility
is hugely, hugely powerful.

00:22:21.190 --> 00:22:23.440
So we're really excited about
both these developments,

00:22:23.440 --> 00:22:25.638
and we really want
you to get involved.

00:22:25.638 --> 00:22:28.180
Keep an ear out for all the next
phase developments, as well.

00:22:28.180 --> 00:22:30.700
We're definitely going to be
looking for people to test out

00:22:30.700 --> 00:22:35.180
those alpha features that
roll out in the future.

00:22:35.180 --> 00:22:37.080
So if you want to
get started, there

00:22:37.080 --> 00:22:39.640
is a quick start available
on the screen right now.

00:22:39.640 --> 00:22:41.350
Please take the
step-by-step process

00:22:41.350 --> 00:22:43.308
because then you'll be
able to get something up

00:22:43.308 --> 00:22:46.475
and running on your cluster
and being able to play a game.

00:22:46.475 --> 00:22:48.850
Finally, thank you so much
for spending your time with me

00:22:48.850 --> 00:22:51.190
and learning today about
Google Cloud Game Servers.

00:22:51.190 --> 00:22:52.360
We're really excited
about working

00:22:52.360 --> 00:22:53.290
with you and your games.

00:22:53.290 --> 00:22:55.707
And we really want to see what
you're going to build next.

00:22:55.707 --> 00:22:57.700
Thank you so much.

00:22:57.700 --> 00:23:01.050
[MUSIC PLAYING]

